```js
// vite.config.js
import tailwindcss from '@tailwindcss/vite';
export default { plugins: [tailwindcss()] };
```
Vite plugin (bukan PostCSS!), `@import` + `@theme` (bukan config JS!), token oklch. Sahkan: tambah `bg-brand` pada markup — jika tiada gaya, semak plugin aktif + kandungan diimbas.

```css
